OL,3,ASpaces in male prisons fall to lowest
OL,4,Alevel of year, sources say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of available spaces across
OL,7,Fthe male prison estate in England and
OL,8,FWales has fallen to its lowest this
OL,9,Fyear, sources have told the BBC.
OL,11,FAs of 1 September, there were about
OL,12,F1,500 free spaces, just under half the
OL,13,Fnumber available at the start of June,
OL,14,Fwhich Ministry of Justice (MoJ) figures
OL,15,Fput at 3,040.
OL,17,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris is due to
OL,18,Fgive more details in the Commons later
OL,19,Fon changes to the early-release scheme,
OL,20,Fwhich aims to free up space in prisons
OL,21,Fas they near maximum capacity.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
