OL,3,ASpaces in male prisons fall to lowest
OL,4,Alevel of year, sources say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,7,Fannounced changes to the scheme, which
OL,8,Fwill mean more prisoners, including
OL,9,Fthose convicted of manslaughter, will
OL,10,Fremain behind bars for longer.
